      "role": "user",
      "content": "the helpline stuff... it doesn't really change anything. it's just words. the truth is i'm just exhausted. every day is the same. the meds, the cleaning, the watching him fade away. it's like i'm just a ghost in my own house. i feel like i died a long time ago, i'm just waiting for my body to realize it.",
